{
  "slug": "byom-review",
  "name": "Byom Review",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Code review with any AI model via OpenRouter. Run standard and adversarial reviews against your working tree or branch using Claude, GPT,  Gemini, Llama, or any other model available on OpenRouter. Returns structured findings with severity, confidence, and actionable\nrecommendations. Includes cost tracking per review.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Commands** (3): `adversarial-review` (Run an adversarial review that challenges implementation approach and design choices), `review` (Run a code review using any model via OpenRouter), `setup` (Check whether the BYOM review plugin is configured with an OpenRouter API key)\n- **Hooks** (2): `SessionStart`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install byom-review@claude-community` from `jkrish/byom-code-review` (`plugins/byom-review`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 3
  },
